# Homelab operator lookup

**Vault** = `hermes-notebook-vault` (Obsidian) — big-picture index; points to **`proxmox-home`**. **Syncthing only — never push the vault to GitHub.**

| Layer | Role | GitHub? |
|-------|------|---------|
| Hermes vault | Network map, service notes, pointers | **No** — Syncthing between machines |
| `proxmox-home` | Canonical topology, `docs/endpoint-index.md`, BWS secret *names* | **Yes** |
| BWS | Secret *values* — `agent-secrets run` / app env injection | **No** |
| Live host | Final truth (SSH, Dockhand, `/health`) | — |

**Rotate secrets:** update BWS + `proxmox-home` docs + Obsidian vault pointer in one session. Never commit values.

**Skills (in `proxmox-home`):** `shared/skills/infrastructure-change-capture`, `add-bws-secret`, `homelab-runtime-check`.

